  <tr>
    <td align=right class=medium valign="top" nowrap><b>Question:</b></td>
    <td align=left class=medium valign="top" width="400" colspan="2">What recent results have been produced from the effects of spinning a large massed object on a shaft at high speed and lifting nthe shaft to the upright poaition through a rotation of 180degrees.<br>
The hypothosis is that it will create its own gravational field and can more easily be pushed away from the earth.</td>
